---String Functions---
for data transformation, analyze, manipulate and clean data

types : 1 single row functions : input single value---> functions ----> single value output
String functions , numeric, DATE & Time , null 
      
: 2 multi row functions  : input multiple values ----> function  ---> single output
  Window fuinctions,aggregate functions.

Nested functions: Input of one function is output for the next function

String FUnctions:

MANipulation: concat, upper,Lower, Trim,Replace.
Caluculation: Len 
String Extraction : Left Right,Substring

---> Concat:

select first_name,country,concat(first_name,country) as name_country
from dbo.customers;

------> Upper: select first_name,country,concat(first_name,country) as name_country, Upper(First_name) as Upper_name
from dbo.customers; 

-------> Lower:select first_name,country,concat(first_name,country) as name_country, Lower(First_name) as low_name
from dbo.customers;

--------> Trim: removes leading and trailing spaces

select first_name From customers where first_name!= Trim(first_name)

--------- > Len:
select first_name, len(first_name) as len_name from customers;


-----------> Replace:not only replace but also remove

select '123-456-7890', replace('123-456-7890', '-','/') as clean_phone

select 'report.txt', Replace('report.txt','.txt','.csv') as new_filename;

--left(value,Nr of character), Right(value,nr of characters)--

select first_name,Left(Trim(first_name),2) first_2_char,Right(first_name,2) last_2_char from customers;


---Substring---

substring(value,start,length)

SElect first_name,SUBSTRING(first_name,2,4) as sub_name from customers

------> Round , ABS-----< 

select 3.156, round(3.156,2) as round_2
select -10, abs(10),abs(-10) 

